---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About AYEGROUPE — Mission, Vision & Structure"
  description="Learn about AYEGROUPE, an agile sole proprietorship combining global software engineering with physical trade and logistics operations in Togo."
  lang="en"
  canonicalPath="/en/a-propos"
>
  <section class="bg-brand-navy py-16 lg:py-24 text-white relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-grid-dark opacity-30 pointer-events-none"></div>
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative">
      <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-6">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-white/10 text-slate-300 border border-white/20 font-mono">
          Organization & Values
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">
          Building the Future Through Software & Ground Agility
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          AYEGROUPE is a forward-thinking sole proprietorship established on a powerful premise: international digital engineering and regional West African ground operations achieve exponential results when driven by shared standards of execution.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 bg-brand-surface">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-16">
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-blue uppercase tracking-widest bg-blue-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-blue-200">
            Genesis & Purpose
          </span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-brand-navy tracking-tight">
            Why Two Distinct Business Divisions?
          </h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
            In today's interconnected global landscape, organizations require partners capable of writing robust enterprise code while concurrently mastering supply chains, hardware procurement, and freight handling in West Africa.
          </p>
          <div class="space-y-3">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-blue text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">1</span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-sm text-brand-navy">IT & Software Division (Global Scope)</strong>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-0.5">Custom software development, cloud systems consulting, and monetized SaaS products (AyePrep, AyeJob) delivered globally.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-gold text-slate-950 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">2</span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-sm text-brand-navy">Togo Hub (Ground & Regional Operations)</strong>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-0.5">General trade, IT hardware supply, ergonomic furniture, warehousing, haulage, and corporate fleet rentals based in Lomé.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-3xl bg-slate-900 text-white border border-slate-800 shadow-2xl space-y-8">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-white">Our Core Principles</h3>
          
          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-brand-blue/20 text-brand-blue-light flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0">
                01
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white">Uncompromising Technical Quality</h4>
                <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">We apply senior architectural rigor to every line of code we write and every piece of IT hardware we deploy.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-brand-gold/20 text-brand-gold flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0">
                02
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white">Contractual Integrity & Transparency</h4>
                <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Clear deliverables, transparent pricing structures, and strict adherence to project milestones.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0">
                03
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white">Rapid Operational Mobilization</h4>
                <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Immediate responsiveness to resolve emergency logistics demands or accelerate mission-critical cloud deployments.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="p-8 rounded-3xl bg-blue-50/70 border border-blue-200/80 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6">
        <div class="space-y-1">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-navy">Legal Status & Official Registration</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm">
            AYEGROUPE operates as a legally registered Sole Proprietorship officially licensed across 38 business activities.
          </p>
        </div>
        <a
          href="/en/mentions-legales"
          class="px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-brand-navy hover:bg-brand-navy-light text-white font-bold text-xs whitespace-nowrap transition-colors"
        >
          View legal disclosures &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
